{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "292133205ae393b1310e2f17f393951435403c6a1926435a93f6435361cc1413", "ja": "（劇場で販売するグッズの一環として、アイドル達の\n写真で、タロットカードを作ることになった）", "zh": "（我们决定用偶像们的照片制作成塔罗牌，\n当成周边商品之一在剧场里贩卖。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "aeb3750eb0275e14c95549f44edae32c88513a3be2428e5c9d16be92dfea1edd", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、可憐だ。準備の方はどうかな……）", "zh": "（今天轮到可怜进行拍摄，不知道她准备得怎么样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "6c84a4f05995acb1f92fe8dc43a5ed9e5fdaa81dacb717c5b13feb4115d25ef7", "ja": "うぅ……。\nい、いったい、どうすればいいんだろう……。", "zh": "呜呜……\n我、我究竟该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1919aece1ad26fc9fc3bc60479cc4eb43ccacc783d9d3065e27ebfbed7934f16", "ja": "？　可憐、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？可怜，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "11f611f0c1e5a41dfeb191b0b31639cdc2fafbc5eb40429168ad5f3ba9d3e9e9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……。\nす、すみません……もう、撮影の時間ですか……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n对、对不起……已经要开始拍摄了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e6700c11d0d34624268aae0caa851ea4252c214c7c31eb711d6f7b0f2d1feed", "ja": "いや、始まるまで、もう少しあるけど……\nそれより、何か心配な事があるなら、相談にのるぞ？", "zh": "不，离拍摄还有一点时间……先不说这个了，\n如果你有什么烦恼，可以跟我商量喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "ec1cd728439e4cd73626fd6932774f798891c1dd0227a7093e4d0a5b4043265f", "ja": "あ、はい……えっと、私……\nタロットは、あまり詳しくなくて……。", "zh": "啊，好的……就是，我……\n对塔罗牌不是很懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "03c7d8958789a5d1c1e88d3cdab228321da2c8bd55f2527e1866a10a6571caad", "ja": "それで、この衣装……女教皇っていうカードのこと、\n調べてみたんです……。", "zh": "所以，我试着去查了这套服装……\n也就是女祭司牌的资料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "015c33c25a7af445f23ab74395bbaff4220bfad397a2415abbedd9085a54c8a0", "ja": "あずささんに聞いたり、本を読んだり……。\nで、でも、そうしたら……うぅ……っ。", "zh": "除了问阿梓姊外，也有从书上找……\n可、可是，查完我才发现……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ea5c46076d94f5217c930264c4dcbfcc960ee85d5f1e5ae7ca30afe33a6f0060", "ja": "な、何かまずい意味でもあったのか？", "zh": "查、查到了什么不好的含义吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "8a1b3de803a87699584da953617f52b0f6a308f54d34d52a999a0dd0f5425f9b", "ja": "はい……り、理知的とか……冷静とか……。\nみ、見守ってくれるとか、良い変化とか……！", "zh": "是的……她代表知性……冷静等等……\n还有像守、守候，跟好的改变之类的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "92d8460f3738e57641f71cd55ec580f691feee9242540834a1fc077849177ff4", "ja": "ど、どれも、私らしくないものばかりで……。\n私、どうしたら……うぅ……。", "zh": "全、全都是跟我相差甚远的特征……\n我该怎么办才好……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4f24dcb1970359f0f8ad6752a4da1c1f732dd90088e8eb244c06a90501bbe9ec", "ja": "え……そうか？\nそんな事ないと思うけど……。", "zh": "咦……会吗？\n我觉得没这回事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "2172fe4518e2652a9fd891c94aa8338ef4fee4b79662fc9ebb85013ac6b20251", "ja": "で、でも……。", "zh": "但、但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1014_p", "source_sha256": "61ed3b8207d50b6839d8d1f8fc0180a53a608471534bfb86d3eb3e526a02272b", "ja": "冷静だから、タロットのことを調べたりしたんだと\n思うし。十分、理知的な証拠じゃないか！", "zh": "你就是个性冷静，才会去查塔罗牌的资料吧？\n这不就代表你充满知性吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "498f10269ac2c1e2e538d3087b0bac61f0b66b5c23ada1d04196ad694e023bbf", "ja": "そ、そうなんでしょうか……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4d22913f83c8fbe2c66da83691e73e0aa30f4d848cd9244fa2e8c398384ca20d", "ja": "ああ。それに良い変化なんて、アイドルとして\nいつも成長を続けてる可憐に、ぴったりだと思うよ。", "zh": "没错。还有，我觉得「好的改变」相当适合\n身为偶像的实力一直在成长的可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "f215211251601238054d79b6c3b1e5f4d315c9de9ed694874737e5fe6307d67e", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、そう言われると……\nほ、本当に、そんな気がしてきちゃいます……。", "zh": "听到{$P$}先生这么说……\n就、就感觉好像真的是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1019_p", "source_sha256": "17643e5ec49a9d7523acb539bf754cdea25104d9d3e994cd90359873324bb819", "ja": "大丈夫だ。心配しなくても、\n可憐はそのカードに相応しいアイドルだ！", "zh": "没问题的。\n可怜你大可放心，你是配得上这张牌的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "6022854dbca2f3731c40d0c1466182770c5345cbedf0bc2d0b823c7d9adeed19", "ja": "てへへ……♪　わ、私……資料で見たカードが、\nすごく、素敵だなって思ってて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪我、我觉得……在资料上看到的女祭司牌，\n真的非常迷人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "9a9833b9e50cfab9c74d681f74ded998b64e7bb2be4004606ec5f9181dd69393", "ja": "堂々として、カッコよくて……わ、私も、\nいつか、こんなふうになれたらいいなぁって……。", "zh": "看起来大方又凛然……让、让我不禁心想，\n要是自己有一天也能变成那样就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "ba14e1f4181399bf113702ef2fee686fa2bc0e531ad8901e93599e8fd88b061f", "ja": "だから……少しでも、近づけてるなら……\nうれしいです……。", "zh": "所以……如果我真的，有那么一点点接近她……\n我会感到很高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1023_p", "source_sha256": "22c0e5cef3a129c41db8201aed36290194d715020a94556827d76953da3bba0e", "ja": "うん、俺が保証するよ！\nそのまま自信を持って、カメラの前に立ってみようか。", "zh": "嗯，我可以向你保证！\n你就带着这份自信，试着站在镜头前吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "6f121fa672148ebc8f105b58d54e973a7f9e24e4c5b26f63e8460e6db4a66f1b", "ja": "は、はい……{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございます……！", "zh": "好、好的……\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0094_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "2e3845706a3415043a42add5294776dffc475870364f8fc81b277ed2089f8cfa", "ja": "私……撮影、がんばりますね……♪", "zh": "拍摄时……我会努力的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
